{"created": "2023-07-12T01:22:43.434973+00:00", "modified": "2023-08-25T13:23:19.195575+00:00", "id": 8129258, "conceptrecid": "8129257", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8129258", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.8129257", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8129258", "metadata": {"title": "PM100: A Job Power Consumption Dataset of a Large-Scale HPC System", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8129258", "publication_date": "2023-07-21", "description": "<p>The dataset is a collection of jobs extracted from the job_table data&nbsp;of M100 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7588815\">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7588815</a>), a collection of&nbsp;data extracted from a&nbsp;Tier-0 supercomputer hosted at CINECA (Marconi100,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.hpc.cineca.it/hardware/marconi100\">https://www.hpc.cineca.it/hardware/marconi100</a>). &nbsp;The original job data present in M100 are filtered out by considering only the jobs running exclusively on the resources. Each job entry included in PM100 contains the power consumption of the resources allocated to the job during its execution. The power consumption values are sampled every 20 seconds&nbsp;at node level, thus including the power contribution&nbsp;of all the components of the nodes&nbsp;(GPUs, CPUs, memory, etc...). The final dataset contains&nbsp;231238 jobs, executed on Marconi100&nbsp;between May and October 2020.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The dataset&nbsp;is stored as a parquet file, where each entry contains the information on&nbsp;a job execution.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The structure of the data, as well as the code to generate them, is contained in the official GitHub repository of the project:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/francescoantici/PM100-data/\">https://github.com/francescoantici/PM100-data/</a>.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Antici, Francesco", "affiliation": "University of Bologna", "orcid": "0000-0002-1125-0588"}, {"name": "Seyedkazemi Ardebili, Mohsen", "affiliation": "University of Bologna", "orcid": "0000-0002-1166-6559"}, {"name": "Bartolini, Andrea", "affiliation": "University of Bologna", "orcid": "0000-0002-1148-2450"}, {"name": "Kiziltan, Zeynep", "affiliation": "University of Bologna", "orcid": "0000-0003-0412-4396"}], "keywords": ["High Performance Computing", "Power Consumption", "Power Prediction", "Workload Manager", "HPC Jobs Dataset"], "version": "1.0", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "8129257"}}]}}, "title": "PM100: A Job Power Consumption Dataset of a Large-Scale HPC System", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8129258", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8129258?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8129258", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8129258", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.8129258", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129257", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8129257", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8129257", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.8129257", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8129258/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8129258/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8129258/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/requests"}, "updated": "2023-08-25T13:23:19.195575+00:00", "recid": "8129258", "revision": 6, "files": [{"id": "ee0a2a0f-5b6e-4311-94a9-447182357b69", "key": "job_table.parquet", "size": 105940147, "checksum": "md5:2a692d9b9dc4a6ee4bc5e3eb3d0fa6f5", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8129258/files/job_table.parquet/content"}}], "swh": {}, "owners": [{"id": "529298"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 2495, "unique_downloads": 1344, "views": 4204, "unique_views": 3835, "version_downloads": 274, "version_unique_downloads": 174, "version_unique_views": 468, "version_views": 522}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}